<speak>Thank you, Mr Tan. Before we draw the main discussion together, I will finish the small housekeeping note so it is not left hanging. You prefer appointments with a clear purpose, arranged individually, and routine contact that respects your work and family schedule. That is about how we organise the relationship, not a change to your account profile today. If you later want help with the digital inbox, we can arrange a separate practical session. There is no need to stay on this call to organise that appointment now. You can come back to it when you are looking at your diary.</speak>